====Maximal story====
While the Maximals chased the Predacons back to their base, Blackarachnia joined Waspinator and Inferno in infiltrating and taking control of the ''Axalon''. {{Storylink|Transformers: Beast Wars Transmetals (PS)}}
====Predacon story====
As part of Megatron's plan, a group of Maximals was baited to the ''Darkside'' while Blackarachnia and Waspinator lured the rest away from the ''Axalon''. {{Storylink|Transformers: Beast Wars Transmetals (PS)}}

===''Transformers Legends''===
Alongside Waspinator and Terrorsaur, Blackarachnia came upon the crash-site of a large stasis pod marked with a red "X". Finding the Maximal Silverbolt already there, a battle ensued. When the content of the pod was accidentally let loose, Blackarachnia and Silverbolt were blown away from the fight by the newly emerged Rampage, and sent flying into a hostile swamp. Finding that they need to rely on one another to survive, Blackarachnia is slowly won over by Silverbolt's chivalrous attitude, despite them being on opposing sides of a war. Eventually returning to where Waspinator, Terrorsaur, and a recently arrived Depth Charge continue to do battle with Rampage, all present manage to defeat Rampage just as Megatron arrives on-site. {{storylink|When Sparks Fly}}

