Blackarachnia is a calculating and opportunistic Predacon who operates entirely in her own self-interest, holding little loyalty to Megatron. A classic femme fatale, she leverages her intellect and striking presence alongside her formidable arachnid abilities. She excels at long-term scheming, constructing complex strategies to ensnare unsuspecting opponents and ensure her own survival and dominance. {{storylink|source:Transformers:_Earth_Wars/2017#Blackarachnia|Blackarachnia Bio}}

Blackarachnia and [[Cheetor (BW)#Transformers: Earth Wars|Cheetor]] were investigating a massive anomaly where Megatron and Optimus Primal had seemingly disappeared. Seeing as both Blackarachnia and Cheetor were reverted to their pre-transmetal states, Cheetor had a hard time believing Blackarachnia could be trusted. {{storylink|Primal Call}} {{storylink|Arachnophobia}} {{storylink|Not So Fast}} {{storylink|String Theory}}

